Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.12,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,你看 阿光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.12,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,見て コウ君
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.12,0:22:56.56,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,天色开始变了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:56.56,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,空の色が変わってきた
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.92,0:23:00.62,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,啊 大概快天亮了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.92,0:23:00.62,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,ああ もうじき夜が明けるかも
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.10,0:23:04.56,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,每次熬夜熬到天亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:04.56,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,よふかしして朝を迎える時の
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.74,0:23:07.72,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,怎么总觉得有点寂寞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:07.72,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,あの寂しさって何なんだろうな
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.42,0:23:11.62,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,明明知道还会有下一个夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:11.62,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,また夜は来るってわかってるのに
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.84,0:23:12.80,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.84,0:23:12.80,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,ですよね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.06,0:23:17.44,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,因为这一夜 过了就不会再有了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.06,0:23:17.44,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,そりゃ その夜は一度しかないからだろう
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.54,0:23:18.08,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:18.08,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,ん？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.74,0:23:21.50,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,下次等来的 就是另一个夜晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:21.50,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,次に来る夜は別の夜なんだよ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.74,0:23:23.76,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,所以才会寂寞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:23.76,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,だから寂しいのさ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.24,0:23:26.62,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,另一个夜晚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.24,0:23:26.62,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,別の夜か
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.29,0:23:28.94,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,另一个夜晚…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.29,0:23:28.94,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,別の夜
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.41,0:23:32.42,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,那就好好享受新的夜晚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.41,0:23:32.42,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,新しい夜を楽しもうぜ
